   display: flex;
   align-items: center;
   justify-content: center;
+  /* Photo viewers sit on a dark stage in both themes: a theme-tinted backdrop competes with the
+     picture and makes the translucent letterbox edges read as a rendering bug. */
+  background: #000;
 
+  /* The preview is the screen: an inset card would cap the picture far below the screen size and
+     clip a zoomed image at its own edge, which reads as "zoom does nothing". */
